00:40:16.022 --> 00:40:20.000
I think . . . Because you're saying all this useful stuff.

581
00:40:20.000 --> 00:40:21.923
<v AMBROSE>Well I'm talking to her.

582
00:40:21.923 --> 00:40:23.077
<v ARSENEAULT>Do you mind?

583
00:40:23.077 --> 00:40:25.000
<v TOWNER>You can go ahead on.

584
00:40:25.000 --> 00:40:26.154
<v ARSENEAULT>Do you care?

585
00:40:26.154 --> 00:40:28.462
I think it will be good.

586
00:40:28.462 --> 00:40:31.154
I need to get both of y'all.

587
00:40:31.154 --> 00:40:37.692
<v AMBROSE>But what I want . . . what I got confused was where Low Top Inn was and Trousdale Road,

588
00:40:37.692 --> 00:40:42.692
because I remember uncle Irvin's wife Aunt [Maime?], her people lived up there.

589
00:40:42.692 --> 00:40:51.538
Before you get to Trousdale Road, it was a big old house that didn't have any paintings as far as I can remember,

