00:40:51.538 --> 00:40:55.000
with a porch all the way across the front.

591
00:40:55.000 --> 00:40:59.615
And [Carlin?] gave me the name, but I didn't write it down.

592
00:40:59.615 --> 00:41:03.077
I'll have to call him back and get it.

593
00:41:03.077 --> 00:41:08.077
But that's where her . . . It was her sister, her auntie, and her grandmother.

594
00:41:08.077 --> 00:41:10.385
That family lived in that house.

595
00:41:10.385 --> 00:41:15.000
But he remember the people and everything, the names and everything.

596
00:41:15.000 --> 00:41:18.845
<v TOWNER>Oh, well they must have been related to him.

597
00:41:18.845 --> 00:41:20.126
<v AMBROSE>I don't know.

