00:41:35.078 --> 00:41:41.058
But he told me who they were, because I couldn't remember the family name.

606
00:41:41.058 --> 00:41:49.602
I just knew Aunt [Maime?] lived there that was some relative of hers, but I couldn't remember the family name.

607
00:41:49.602 --> 00:41:52.592
But I knew it was past Sullivan’s.

608
00:41:52.592 --> 00:41:54.301
