00:41:55.583 --> 00:41:59.000
But before you get to Trousdale Road.

611
00:41:59.000 --> 00:42:06.885
<v TOWNER>I don't . . . I can't remember who . . . no big house over in that area.

612
00:42:06.885 --> 00:42:18.410
