616
00:42:27.508 --> 00:42:29.328
<v AMBROSE>They're from Westlake.

617
00:42:29.328 --> 00:42:29.934
Shelton.

618
00:42:29.934 --> 00:42:36.000
They're the Sheltons, because that's her name now, Shelton.

619
00:42:36.000 --> 00:42:39.774
<v TOWNER>No. Yes, I know, but it wasn't the Sheltons.

620
00:42:39.774 --> 00:42:42.710
