621
00:42:42.710 --> 00:42:45.645
<v AMBROSE>You remember now what I'm talking about?

622
00:42:45.645 --> 00:42:46.065
<v TOWNER>[Agrees]

623
00:42:46.065 --> 00:42:48.161
<v AMBROSE>But I can't remember their . . .

624
00:42:48.161 --> 00:42:49.000
<v TOWNER>No.

625
00:42:49.000 --> 00:43:00.162
<v AMBROSE>I'm going to have to go find my paper where I had started it and see . . . call Carl Ray and let him tell me who they are again.

626
00:43:00.162 --> 00:43:07.736
And then when I went down Trousdale Road, I remember it had the [Eglins?], Roy Mayfield and the Bryants.

627
00:43:07.736 --> 00:43:14.115
And then on the other side of the road was . . . over the corner was Joy Hill,

628
00:43:14.115 --> 00:43:17.703
